"s":78,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"78:34","t":"And a full cup.","j":30,"h":59,"s":78,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"78:35","t":"No ill speech will they hear therein or any falsehood -","j":30,"h":59,"s":78,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"78:36","t":"[As] reward from your Lord, [a generous] gift [made due by] account,","j":30,"h":59,"s":78,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"78:37","t":"[From] the Lord of the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them, the Most Merciful. They possess not from Him [authority for] speech.","j":30,"h":59,"s":78,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"78:38","t":"The Day that the Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] and the angels will stand in rows, they will not speak except for one whom the Most Merciful permits, and he will say what is correct.","j":30,"h":59,"s":78,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"78:39","t":"That is the True [i.e., certain] Day; so he who wills may take to his Lord a [way of] return.","j":30,"h":59,"s":78,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"78:40","t":"Indeed, We have warned you of an impending punishment on the Day when a man will observe what his hands have put forth and the disbeliever will say, \"Oh, I wish that I were dust!\"","j":30,"h":59,"s":78,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"79:1","t":"By those [angels] who extract with violence","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"79:2","t":"And [by] those who remove with ease","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"79:3","t":"And [by] those who glide [as if] swimming","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"79:4","t":"And those who race each other in a race","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"79:5","t":"And those who arrange [each] matter,","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"79:6","t":"On the Day the blast [of the Horn] will convulse [creation],","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"79:7","t":"There will follow it the subsequent [one].","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"79:8","t":"Hearts, that Day, will tremble,","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"79:9","t":"Their eyes humbled.","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"79:10","t":"They are [presently] saying, \"Will we indeed be returned to [our] former state [of life]?","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"79:11","t":"Even if we should be decayed bones?\"","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"79:12","t":"They say, \"That, then, would be a losing return.\"","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"79:13","t":"Indeed, it will be but one shout,","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"79:14","t":"And suddenly they will be [alert] upon the earth's surface.","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"79:15","t":"Has there reached you the story of Moses? -","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"79:16","t":"When his Lord called to him in the sacred valley of Ṭuwā,","j":30,"h":59,"s":79,"a":16,"sd":null}],"juz":30,"hizb":59,"surahs":[78,79],"sajdah":false}